# Normalise line endings in the index, and force LF on what runs on Linux.
# A CRLF shell script inside a build pod takes a wrong branch and reports
# success; a Containerfile with CRLF confuses line continuations. Windows
# checkouts may still show CRLF in the working tree; the index does not.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
Containerfile text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
.githooks/* text eol=lf
